       answers on independence, cost and timing are in
       <a href="/consulting/#questions">the assessment's questions</a>.</p>

    <h3>Do you work in Saudi Arabia, Qatar, Kuwait, Bahrain and Oman?</h3>
    <p>Yes. We are based in Dubai and work on site with businesses of twenty staff or more across
       the UAE, Saudi Arabia, Qatar, Kuwait, Bahrain and Oman. The timeline is agreed in writing
       before we start.</p>
  </section>
